.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH NAME
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
OMShell\-terminal \- interactive OpenModelica shell in the terminal
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH SYNOPSIS
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
.B OMShell\-terminal
.RB [ \-f
.IR script.mos ]
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH DESCRIPTION
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
.B OMShell\-terminal
reads OpenModelica scripting commands from the terminal and evaluates them
one at a time, with line editing and a history kept in
.IR ~/.mosh_history .
Type
.B help()
for an overview of the commands and
.B quit()
or end\-of\-file to leave.
.PP
It links the OpenModelica compiler in rather than starting
.BR omc .
Generated code and result files are written to the current working
directory, so start it from a scratch directory.
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH OPTIONS
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
.TP
.BI \-f " script.mos"
Run
.I script.mos
and print its result instead of starting an interactive session.
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH FILES
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
.TP
.I ~/.mosh_history
The command history, limited to 3000 entries.
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
